  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Teddy Magazine editorial intern, Yoo Ji-yoo.\nOne day, right before the magazine's deadline, the main article falls through.\nThen comes a special mission from the editor-in-chief, notoriously known as the \"witch.\"\n\nThe task? An exclusive interview with the photographer Jake (JAKE), who is secretly returning to Korea!\nBut at the airport, the Jake I meet is someone I know...\n\n\"Do-hyung oppa?\"\n\"And you're just standing there while I'm about to be devoured by the witch?\"\n\nHis familiar low voice and signature musky scent.\nBut unlike before, everything about him feels awkward.\nWhen he speaks to me or his touch brushes against me, my toes tingle for some reason.\n\nWhen he beckons me with a playful smile, asking why I’m not coming into his arms already,\nat that moment, he is no longer just \"my brother’s friend.\"\n\n\"You’re so cute when you talk.\"\n\"…Uh. What should I say to that?\"\n\"You’re so beautiful I want to kiss you.\"\n\nYoo Ji-yoo’s sweet romance with the dangerous Seo Do-hyung and her one and only drop.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/content/63733643)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/167860)",
